From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Onyx contributors <onyx@localhost>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:50:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/17] [Onyx] WebKit2 for Onyx: the port's files, the software
 drawing path, the IPC monitor thread, the launcher of the one multi-call
 program, the C API and the Onyx view

Source/WebKit/PlatformOnyx.cmake and ONYX_WEBKIT (OptionsOnyx.cmake: a static libWebKit); the
software drawing path behind USE(NON_COMPOSITED_DRAWING_AREA) beside the coordinated graphics
guards (DrawingAreaCoordinatedGraphics, UpdateInfo, BackingStoreSkia with no compositor; a stub
LayerTreeHostOnyx.h); ConnectionUnix's socket monitor thread (PlayStation's) for Onyx with a
shutdown before the close, EPIPE as a closed peer; the process paths (WebProcessPool, the network
process); the native event factories, the pasteboard, WKBase / WKAPICast for __onyx__; SQLite
without WAL on Onyx (no writable shared file mapping). New files under */onyx/: the launcher
(posix_spawn of the running program with --onyx-webkit-process=web|network), PageClientImpl,
OnyxWebView, the web process, WebPageOnyx (the editing key tables), WebsiteDataStoreOnyx, the C
API (WKView, WKViewClient, WKPagePrivateOnyx with WKPagePaint, WKRunLoop, WKEventOnyx,
WKAuxiliaryProcessOnyx, WKContextConfigurationOnyx). curl's CurlTLSBackend.h exported. Built and
run on the posixsim bench: the three processes load a page (data:, file:, http:) and paint it.
