+// Paints the page's picture (the backing store kept in this process) into the embedder's pixels, typically
+// from the view client's setViewNeedsDisplay.
+//
+// pixels: the top left pixel of a surface that stands for the whole view: the view's point (0, 0) is its
+// first pixel. 32 bits per pixel, premultiplied alpha, 0xAARRGGBB as a 32-bit word (B, G, R, A in memory:
