+# WebKit, the multi-process layer (step 3 of the port), is built with -DONYX_WEBKIT=ON on top of
+# WebCore: a static libWebKit.a holding the code of the three roles (UI, web and network
+# processes). The program that is shipped is one multi-call executable linked outside this build
